# <first-gate> <last-gate|-> <command>   (Story 6.5.6, Gate F: the real binary, the large tree, the full disk)
# The pty journeys (explore_pty, explore_delete_pty) and the full-disk leg (explore_fulldisk, which drives
# rehearse-full-disk.sh --cache-too) are cargo/Bazel tests, so the "bazel test //..." step of scripts/gate.sh runs
# them with the gate-d registry; check-release-features.sh (A -, 0.1.3.required) now also fails on a release or dist
# binary that holds DC_EXPLORE_PANIC_AT or DC_EXPLORE_PLAN_DELAY_MS, in its Cargo and its Bazel legs.
# The full bench (676,296 directories, wall-clock bounds) is run by hand and by the owner: scripts/bench-explore.sh.
F - scripts/bench-explore.sh --selftest
F - scripts/bench-explore.sh --smoke
F - scripts/rehearse-full-disk.sh --selftest
